  "details": "VRChat Version: 2021.1.5p3\nDescription of the bug: For some reason, when sending a friend request to someone, VRChat did not pull my VRChat name, but either the name of my Oculus account that I had merged or my Steam account, as someone had told me they received a friend request from \"Raven,\" which is definitely my Steam name, not sure if it was also my Oculus name, but it would not surprise me if it was.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): Merge an Oculus account to a VRChat account, and send friend requests. Perhaps it would pop up. Specifically in my case, I was using Virtual Desktop streaming SteamVR to my Quest 2. I logged in via VRChat directly at the login prompt leading up to this issue.\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): Nothing in the output log suggests anything to do with Raven, but the Support email will get the full log for the staff's perusal.",
